e, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fe097a9aa70b5a44cb2a224f4fb3ca3e3265cf01", "message": "error 404", "created_at": "2021-07-30T20:49:15Z", "repo": "Ingresos-Egresos", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5bbfe501d01ee3aa19ff405097113c5daf4700a4", "message": "Framework principal\n\nPoms dados por el ingeniero alexander a\u00f1adidos", "created_at": "2021-07-30T19:45:04Z", "repo": "Ingresos-Egresos", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e07e9f838fdcb299b844acdfcbb29a69e938d87b", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2021-07-15T19:49:10Z", "repo": "Ingresos-Egresos", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a01d68d523ae1dc0deabaa7ea7737a27e4561176", "message": "Merge pull request #15 from kleecollage/plantilla/kevin\n\nPlantilla propuesta", "created_at": "2022-04-22T17:07:07Z", "repo": "proyectoAdmin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "04321bd0baae64a5b84a70e1a7f37d71917a4969", "message": "Plantilla propuesta\n\nUna p\u00e1gina HTML/CSS  creada con Bootstrap 5. Este tema es perfecto para agencias o peque\u00f1as empresas que buscan configurar una p\u00e1gina de inicio simple para su empresa.", "created_at": "2022-04-20T00:06:52Z", "repo": "proyectoAdmin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "a60f51bef7dfcd17c0bd6715a31687a1f00e6e5f", "message": "Maquetaci\u00f3n update\n\nSe han logrado modular las partes de header y footer, adem\u00e1s de los estilos de la p\u00e1gina en general.\nSe tienen enrutadas las p\u00e1ginas de login, admin, home, not found.\n\nToda el API desarrollada est\u00e1 integrada dentro del proyecto en la carpeta API.\n\nInstalaci\u00f3n de NodeJS y uso Angular10\n\nDependencia Typeorm en version 0.2\n\n*Revisar la modulaci\u00f3n de la p\u00e1gina home*\n\n*Revisar modulaci\u00f3n de users*\n\n*Revisar estilos de la p\u00e1gina home*\n\nSugiero implementar la plantilla de home por partes separadas (HEADER, FOOTER, BODY) e ir viendo como funciona una por una\n\nSugiero  generar nuevo modulo en home para el enrutamiento del CRUD", "created_at": "2022-04-19T20:47:30Z", "repo": "proyectoAdmin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c284ac9c8117545f7c906b59f90c660011e0e580", "message": "Actualizaci\u00f3n API\n\nSe utiliz\u00f3 Express para la base de datos, adem\u00e1s de Typeorm, NodeJS & JWT para las passwords.\nLas contrase\u00f1as son encriptadas en la base de datos.\nBase de datos local en puerto 3000\nPOSTS & GETS con Postman exitosas\n\n*Verificar actualizaci\u00f3n de paquetes*\n\n*Verificar m\u00e9todo getRepository de TypeORM posiblemente obsoleto*", "created_at": "2022-04-19T18:57:04Z", "repo": "proyectoAdmin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "0f1de4aaa2d1e69e7a1f1045714b08ab4e49bfd7", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2022-04-17T18:16:51Z", "repo": "proyectoAdmin", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4fc90793176beb21c8a9574f84a7178dd1011189", "message": "Merge pull request #10 from kleecollage/function_delete\n\nFuncion delete y bugs", "created_at": "2022-07-12T19:22:07Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fcc6fa0c8e0e76fca13441f1a33547907166d811", "message": "Merge branch 'main' into function_delete", "created_at": "2022-07-12T19:20:58Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c0a14bf72f17e1b447a5eb44bb24b47121608b0d", "message": "Merge pull request #8 from kleecollage/Funcion_Insert\n\nCreaci\u00f3n de las funciones insert", "created_at": "2022-07-12T19:12:30Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5ea5911276177a980e6f206e4707ccd11eed5598", "message": "Funcion delete y bugs\n\nSe a\u00f1adi\u00f3 la funci\u00f3n eliminar en el CRUD para todas las tablas, adem\u00e1s se resolvieron errores que se encontraron del \u00faltimo c\u00f3digo", "created_at": "2022-07-12T19:09:58Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e4519d10d76e9119c3b993b3246e6d8a8612cec5", "message": "Creaci\u00f3n de las funciones insert\n\nSe comprob\u00f3 la correcta ejecuci\u00f3n de las funciones INSERT para los formularios de profesores, materias y alumnos", "created_at": "2022-07-05T19:57:14Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4d41a3bf4233cdd54dc037484382d9adb2cda3dc", "message": "Merge pull request #7 from kleecollage/Formularios_SeccionDetails\n\nFormularios secci\u00f3n details", "created_at": "2022-06-28T21:09:28Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "ba2086def8bf3baa402e7f1bbde9bdfce16827ad", "message": "Formulario de registro para profesores\n\nSe cre\u00f3 un formulario con un dise\u00f1o distinto al de alumnos y materias; se uso bootstrap5, fontsawesome y un poco de css", "created_at": "2022-06-28T21:07:07Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "703f578d0d0fbd021bfaf33895a82fecb9cadeb8", "message": "Formularios materias\n\nSe cre\u00f3 un formulario con bootstrap 5 para el insert y el update de materias", "created_at": "2022-06-28T20:32:35Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "6f96a81ae655de93cdb86963e8c24d7af262572c", "message": "Delete escuela-bd directory", "created_at": "2022-06-28T19:49:18Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "19b7f3a51720fab5fde41339dc05e5da9213b466", "message": "Merge pull request #6 from kleecollage/Formularios_SeccionDetails\n\nDetails funcionales & Formularios", "created_at": "2022-06-28T19:48:22Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "c24e530fa89ac09fe32ec3c8434e0774b18fa6af", "message": "Details funcionales & Formularios\n\nSe comprob\u00f3 que funcionara la secci\u00f3n \"detalles\" para cada tabla (alumnos, profesores, materias)\n\nSe cre\u00f3 una estructura b\u00e1sica de formulario para el insert y el update de alumnos", "created_at": "2022-06-28T19:38:01Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fa5dd6c40943064399ccdb848a82b986ad6b77e8", "message": "Merge pull request #1 from kleecollage/primera_entrega\n\nc\u00f3digo de conexi\u00f3n a bd local 'Escuela'", "created_at": "2022-06-28T19:26:03Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "e47d2d1138b73f8d8958b05c97857368998cb661", "message": "c\u00f3digo de conexi\u00f3n a bd local 'Escuela'\n\nSe crea la conexi\u00f3n local a 3 tablas", "created_at": "2022-06-17T22:37:40Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fa219adf484a287793a7e2869b7553d50691bce3", "message": "Initial commit", "created_at": "2022-06-17T22:32:48Z", "repo": "bd-pech", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5a8d6bf5475d53e7fe086d0a2e5de332c22dc2eb", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2026-02-08T04:05:27Z", "repo": "kleecollage", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "7f0c8ebce85b18680eb84b0ac8ae2240bee69d51", "message": "Update README.md", "created_at": "2026-02-08T03:59:42Z", "repo": "kleecollage", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "4bf06f075bcd6dd31398ce8b22e2ad59112578f0", "message": "Update README.md to streamline stats and icons", "created_at": "2026-02-08T03:55:52Z", "repo": "kleecollage", "file_sampled